        },
        {
          "text": "Nomuyandwa, ndakalisungweede kumulembela makani aalufutuko ndotufutusigwa toonse, nywebo aswebo, nkabela lino moyo wangu wandisinikizya kumulembela akumukombelezya kuti mulwanine lusyomo ndobakapegwa basalali lomwe lwalyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.3",
