                  "text": "2 Pet 2:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kulisobelede akati kanu bamwi bantu, abakalembeledwe nkuko kale. Mbasikasampusampu, balasandula luzyalo lwa-Leza wesu kuba zisusi zibi, alimwi balatama Jesu Kristo, ngonguwe alike Simalelo wesu, Mwami wesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.4",
