        {
          "text": "Abalo baangelo abatakajatisya bwami bwabo bwakusaanguna pele bakabusia busena bwabo, wakabaanga azyaanzyo zitamani mumudima uusia mbi, kuti bakalindile mane kusikila kulubeteko lwabuzuba bupati. ",
