        {
          "text": "Anu Mikayelo angelo simutwe, naakali kuzumanana a-Saatani akukazyanya mutunta wa-Musa, wakayoowa kumubeteka cakusampaula, wakaamba buyo kuti, Jehova akutapatile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
